    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Workshop Demi-Sanctum.</strong> Given time and materials, you can turn a workshop into a minor holy site of repair.</p><ul><li>When you have at least a week of downtime in a single location with access to tools and materials, you can establish a <strong>Demi-Sanctum Workshop</strong>.</li><li>Creatures who take a Soma Break while you are actively maintaining this workshop may recover one additional <strong>level of Stress</strong> (GM’s discretion for stacking with other effects) and reroll the lowest die on <strong>Soul check</strong> against despair or hopelessness for the next day.</li><li>On the campaign layer, this location becomes a <strong>key asset</strong>: your faction may gain small bonuses to repair, healing, or Tikkun-related projects done there.</li></ul>",
